meta {
  name: 4. Get Photo File
  type: http
  seq: 4
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/photos/{{photoId}}/file
  body: none
  auth: none
}

headers {
  X-Telegram-Init-Data: {{initData}}
}

docs {
  The actual image bytes — for a photo with no spoiler this just shows
  it directly; for a spoiler photo this IS the "tap to reveal" action
  (the frontend shows a generic spoiler overlay without calling this at
  all until tapped). For a free spoiler this always succeeds. For a
  paid one without a purchase, expect 402 with {"reason":
  "payment_required", "price_stars": N} — run "5. Purchase Photo" first
  to unlock it, then retry this.
}
